<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches played in the German first division on Saturday:</p>
<p> Freiburg			1  Borussia Dortmund     2</p>
<p> VfB Stuttgart		 4  Hamburg		   1</p>
<p> Borussia Moenchengladbach 4  Werder Bremen	   1</p>
<p> St. Pauli		     2  Karlsruhe		 4</p>
<p> Duisburg			0  Arminia Bielefeld     0</p>
<p> 1860 Munich		   3  Fortuna Duesseldorf   0</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p> Hansa Rostock		 0  Cologne		   0</p>
<p> Bochum			  0 Schalke		    1</p>
<p>Playing on Sunday:</p>
<p> Bayer Leverkusen	    v Bayern Munich</p>
